msgid "Merge all HiFi generated elements into a single clean mesh and automatically weld overlapping vertices"
msgstr "将所有 HiFi 生成的元素合并为单个干净网格，并自动焊接重叠顶点"

#: hifi_builder/operators.py:188
#: hifi_builder/ui.py:34
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Prepare For Export"
msgstr "准备导出"

#: hifi_builder/hifi_custom_rig.py:898
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Prepare the selected custom rig's existing Action, convert Drawables, create the anim@ Clip Dictionary, and configure the YTYP Archetype. Does not generate spin animation."
msgstr "准备所选自定义绑定现有的动作，转换 Drawable，创建 anim@ Clip Dictionary，并配置 YTYP 原型。不会生成旋转动画。"

#: hifi_builder/operators.py:178
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Purge all unlinked textures, meshes, and unused data-blocks from the blend file and generate a detailed report file"
msgstr "清除 blend 文件中所有未关联的纹理、网格和未使用的数据块，并生成详细报告文件"

#: hifi_builder/operators.py:94
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Read location, rotation (converted to degrees), and scale from the active 3D object into the inspector memory"
msgstr "从活动 3D 物体读取位置、旋转（转换为角度）和缩放到检查器内存中"

#: hifi_builder/operators.py:50
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Remove all temporary interactive preview meshes from the 3D viewport without affecting saved scene meshes"
msgstr "从 3D 视图中移除所有临时交互预览网格，不影响已保存的场景网格"

#: hifi_builder/hifi_dual_anim.py:79
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Rig and animate a 2-mesh prop (Static Base + Spinning Part) into a complete GTA V export-ready Sollumz Drawable, anim@ Clip Dictionary, and YTYP Archetype"
msgstr "为 2 网格道具（静态底座 + 旋转部件）绑定并制作动画，生成完整的可导出 GTA V 的 Sollumz Drawable、anim@ Clip Dictionary 和 YTYP 原型"

